<text x="162.8828375" y="443.82995" size="3.81" layer="104">FABRICTION NOTES:</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="430.788065625" size="3.81" layer="104">1)  Finished trace line widths should match
supplied gerber files (except where noted).</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="403.73808125" size="3.81" layer="104">3)  Copper weight;
Outer layers:  H oz finished weight
Inner layers:  1/2 oz</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="379.345190625" size="3.81" layer="104">4)  Top Solder mask: per IPC-SMA-840
X Liquid photoimageable
X Over bare copper
X Green</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="366.5448625" size="3.81" layer="104">5)  Bottom Solder mask: 
X None</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="353.502978125" size="3.81" layer="104">6)  Overall Board Thickness:
0.108 inches +/- 10%</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="340.943946875" size="3.81" layer="104">7)  Bare Board Electrical Test:
X Tested to Netlist Data</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="321.622675" size="3.81" layer="104">8)  Hole Diameter Tolerances:
Plated Holes:  +/- 3 mils
Non-plated Holes:  +/- 2 mils</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="297.22953125" size="3.81" layer="104">9)  Silk Screen:
Top:  White
Bottom: None
</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="285.0314375" size="3.81" layer="104">10)  Minimum annular rings:
Control most rings to minimum 2mil, 
small part of vias may have rings less than 2mil but no broken rings.</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="265.957559375" size="3.81" layer="104">11)  Plane registration: 
+/- 5 mils to top plane for all planes
</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="258.955796875" size="3.81" layer="104">12)  Minimum plating:
0.7 mil thick copper for thru holes; 0.4mil for blind vias</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="251.95403125" size="3.81" layer="104">13)  Fabricate in accordance with IPC-6012 Class 3</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="238.916465625" size="3.81" layer="104">14)  ENIG finish per IPC-4552</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="232.156003125" size="3.81" layer="104">15)  Warp &amp; Twist not to exceed 7 mils per inch across the diagonal</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="219.1184375" size="3.81" layer="104">16)  Acceptability: (per latest revision)
IPC-A-600</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="206.32216875" size="3.81" layer="104">17)  Manufacturer to add MFR's Logo, date code,
UL code and ET stamp.  Top Layer only.</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="193.767203125" size="3.81" layer="104">18) Vendor to supply cross sections and test
coupons per lot.</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="169.381934375" size="3.81" layer="104">19) Surface mount pads:
  Top Layer:  2228
  Bot Layer:        0
         Total:  2228</text>
<text x="162.8828375" y="423.059609375" size="3.81" layer="104">2)  Material:  mid-Tg (&gt;=150C) FR4</text>
<dimension x1="-102.57566875" y1="385.992609375" x2="102.57566875" y2="385.992609375" x3="0" y3="423.291" textsize="4.318" layer="104" visible="yes"/>
<text x="-172.72" y="220.98" size="4.826" layer="104">MFR Logo etc should be 
placed interior to this boundary</text>
<text x="-57.9635625" y="181.251609375" size="4.826" layer="104">NOTE:  24 Controlled Depth non-plated holes;
(50+/-5 mils depth and 50 mils diameter); 
2 holes for each connector; From top layer inward.</text>
<text x="-77.0135625" y="154.581609375" size="4.826" layer="104">NOTE:  2 Controlled Depth non-plated holes;
(50+/-5 mils depth and 70 mils diameter); From top layer inward.</text>
